	(text "USB-C input, PD sink (AP33772S, I2C 0x52), output switch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3f79a94e-6e71-5c27-8c80-85498ce02e7d")
	)
	(text "Output live at 5 V whenever the firmware is not running (blank / bootloader): accepted (requirements s3).\nFirmware writes SYSTEM = 0x11 (off), clears PDCONFIG.EPR_MODE_EN and CONFIG.DR_EN within 100 ms of attach.\nOne NMOS: body diode blocks VBUS -> OUT when off (DS allows a single NMOS). PWR_EN direct to the gate (RotoPD).\nR10 5 mOhm (DS OCP section): ISENP at the connector side, VCC after it. VSEL open = 5 V at attach.\nNTC on OTP (100 uA source); default table = Murata NCP03XH103, same curve. DP/DN open: moisture detection off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b468a15c-770d-5eeb-bba6-0fbdc694ee86")
	)
	(text "Logic supplies"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04650380-5fad-50f7-a820-0945f06dd9df")
	)
	(text "SGM2203 from VBUS_S (after the shunt, as RotoPD): its ~20-40 mA reads as output current (1-2 LSB)\nPPS clamped >= 5.0 V in firmware: below that the SGM2203 drops out"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1fa977b2-84f5-5b9b-a512-5a4242c0c350")
	)
	(text "MCU (CH552P) + buttons"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7899c42f-811c-565c-b2d8-95b58f0abd7e")
	)
	(text "Hold SEL (CYCLE) while plugging in: D1 + R4 pull D+ up -> CH552 ROM USB bootloader"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "738b20d2-acab-5a73-b7d5-0fc8cdd21039")
	)
	(text "SW1-SW4: TS-1088 4 x 3 mm, top-actuated (printed plungers). Front: [ON]  [SEL]  [UP][DN]\nR1/R2 2.2k to 3.3 V: CH552 reset pull-up (140 uA) keeps the bus < 3.7 V (OLED VDD abs max 4 V)\nR12/R13 150R: firmware runs P1.6/P1.7 open drain, no pull-up (P1_MOD_OC=1, P1_DIR_PU=0); the resistors limit a mistake"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d28aa160-b526-529c-ac42-45c8eaa569d4")
	)
	(text "OLED 0.69in 96x16, internal charge pump (FPC hand-soldered)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e84787a6-ec63-5a9e-84e9-d746803102b7")
	)
	(text "VBAT = VDD = 3.3 V (VBAT 3.3-4.2 V with internal DC/DC, N069 DS)\nR11 910k sets segment current (IREF); RES#: RC power-on reset 10k / 100n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1fe28d5-cf88-563d-8b61-16f7f8f7d41c")
	)
